<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
FILE:      app/addons/kwtsms/addon.xml
CREATED:   2026-10-20 19:51 +03
TASK:      596
AUTHOR:    kwtSMS
WHAT:      Scheme 3.0 manifest of the kwtSMS add-on: id, version, compatibility, hidden settings (PRD 9),
           the Phase 1 tables (PRD 8), the four privileges (PRD 7) and the install/uninstall hooks.
WHY:       CS-Cart installs, upgrades and removes the add-on from this file. Install creates the nine
           Phase 1 tables and the privileges; uninstall removes every trace listed in PRD 13 (tables,
           privileges and their usergroup grants, notification rows, storage_data keys, language values).
USAGE:     Read by CS-Cart (Admin > Add-ons > Manage add-ons, or fn_install_addon('kwtsms')).
           Settings are hidden items (written by the add-on's own pages); the only visible ones are the
           info link to the add-on's Settings page and marketplace_license_number.
2026-10-22 13:13 +03: 1.1.0 adds four Milestone A tables (13 in all), two columns and the setting vendor_monthly_quota
           (Task A1, task 596); the upgrade path from 1.0.0 is upgrades/1.1.0 (tools/build-upgrade-package.sh).
2026-10-23 15:11 +03: 1.2.0 adds three tables (16 in all: kwtsms_otp_codes, kwtsms_rate_limits, kwtsms_phone_index) and
           23 hidden settings for the phone and SMS-code features, all OFF by default (Task M1.1a, task 596); the
           upgrade path from 1.1.0 and 1.0.0 is upgrades/1.2.0 (Task M1.1b).
DEPENDS:   func.php (fn_kwtsms_install, fn_kwtsms_uninstall, fn_kwtsms_settings_info),
           var/langs/{en,ar}/addons/kwtsms.po, design/backend/media/images/addons/kwtsms/icon.png.
-->
